  "vary": {
    "0.variation": {
      "abs": 100000
    }
  },
  "notes": "v0.34 weapon_stems (docs/weapon_stems.md): source 'sword_clash', rebuilt from stems of a CC0 recording (THIRD_PARTY.md). A single real gesture or a short natural count by default. The seed macro (or any variation) remixes the real stems; nothing is averaged, bands are not pitch-shifted (size is tape speed), and there is no freeze, time-squeeze or added smoothing. Older macro names from the previous recipe still parse; hardness, muffle and intensity map lightly onto force and softness, and unused names are accepted as no-ops."
}
